    <briefdescription>
<para>MatchContext can repurpose existing patterns to behave differently under a certain context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For instance, <computeroutput>m_Opc(ISD::ADD)</computeroutput> matches plain ADD nodes in normal circumstances, but matches VP_ADD nodes under a custom <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_p_match_context" kindref="compound">VPMatchContext</ref>. This design is meant to facilitate code / pattern reusing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
